#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/sd2.asn
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	data
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Concise
#Data requested:	Domain hits
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: NO
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#DOMAINS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<hit-type>	<PSSM-ID>	<from>	<to>	<E-Value>	<bitscore>	<accession>	<short-name>	<incomplete>	<superfamily PSSM-ID>
#more such lines......
#ENDDOMAINS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	678	NP_417616.1 outer membrane lipoprotein - activator of MrcA activity [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
1	Query_1	Specific	442341	1	678	0	656.652	COG3107	LpoA	-	-
ENDDOMAINS
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_2	Peptide	153	NP_418053.1 tetratricopeptide-like domain-containing protein YibG [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
1	Query_2	Non-specific	440553	53	135	3.37817e-07	48.0007	COG0790	TPR	NC	-
ENDDOMAINS
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
ENDDATA
